#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:-1
msgid "Introduction to Kdenlive video editor"
msgstr "Úvod do video editora Kdenlive"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, Introduction, documentation, user manual, video editor, open "
"source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, Introduction, documentation, user manual, video editor,open  "
"source, free, learn, easy"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:30
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Úvod"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Kdenlive** is an acronym for |kde_org| **N**\\ on-\\ **Li**\\ near **V**\\ "
"ideo **E**\\ ditor."
msgstr ""
"**Kdenlive** je skratka pre |kde_org| **N**\\ e-\\ **Li**\\ neárny **V**\\ "
"ideo **E**\\ ditor."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:36
msgid ""
"It is a free software (|gpl_licensed|) primarily aimed at the Linux "
"platform, but it also works on BSD\\ [1]_  as it relies only on portable "
"components (|qt| and |mlt|). Windows versions are also available, with some "
"drawbacks. See :ref:`troubleshooting-windows_issues` for more information. A "
"port on MacOS is also available."
msgstr ""
"Je to slobodný softvér (|gpl_licensed|) zameraný predovšetkým na platformu "
"Linux, ale funguje aj na BSD\\ [1]_ , pretože využíva iba prenositeľné "
"komponenty (|qt| a |mlt|). K dispozícii sú aj verzie pre Windows s určitými "
"obmedzeniami. Viac informácií nájdete v časti :ref:`troubleshooting-"
"windows_issues`. Dostupný je aj port pre MacOS."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:58
msgid ""
"Through the MLT framework **Kdenlive** integrates many effects for video and "
"audio processing or creation. Furthermore, **Kdenlive** brings a powerful :"
"doc:`title editor </titles_and_graphics/titles/titles>`, a :doc:`subtitling "
"</effects_and_filters/subtitles>` feature with AI-supported :doc:`speech to "
"text </effects_and_filters/speech_to_text>` conversion, :ref:`nested "
"timelines <sequence>` (new in version 23.04), :doc:`animation </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/animation>` support through "
"Glaxnimate integration (new in version 22.08) and thus can be used as a "
"complete studio for video creation. Check out :doc:`/more_information/"
"whats_new` for the most recent feature additions."
msgstr ""
"Prostredníctvom rámca MLT **Kdenlive** integruje množstvo efektov na "
"spracovanie alebo tvorbu videa a audia. **Kdenlive** navyše ponúka výkonný :"
"doc:`editor titulkov </titles_and_graphics/titles/titles>`, funkciu :doc:"
"`titulkovania </effects_and_filters/subtitles>` s konverziou :doc:`reči na "
"text </effects_and_filters/speech_to_text>` podporovanou umelou "
"inteligenciou, :ref:`vnorené časové osi <sequence>` (novinka vo verzii "
"23.04), podporu :doc:`animácií </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"animation>` prostredníctvom integrácie Glaxnimate (novinka vo verzii 22.08), "
"a teda ho možno použiť ako kompletné štúdio na tvorbu videa. Pozrite si :doc:"
"`/more_information/whats_new` pre najnovšie pridané funkcie."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:63
msgid "Video editing features"
msgstr "Funkcie pre strih videa"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:65
msgid ""
"Multitrack editing with a timeline and virtually unlimited number of video "
"and audio tracks, plus the ability to split audio and video from a clip in "
"multiple tracks"
msgstr ""
"Viacstopový strih s časovou osou a prakticky neobmedzeným počtom video a "
"audio stôp, plus možnosť rozdeliť audio a video z klipu do viacerých stôp"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:67
msgid "3-point editing"
msgstr "3-bodový strih"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:69
msgid ""
"Non-blocking rendering. You can keep working on a project at the same time a "
"project is being transformed into a video file"
msgstr ""
"Neblokujúci rendering. Počas transformácie projektu na video súbor môžete "
"naďalej pracovať na projekte"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:71
msgid ""
"Dozens of effects and transitions that can be used with ease and even saved "
"as custom effects with their settings for use in other projects"
msgstr ""
"Desiatky efektov a prechodov, ktoré sa dajú jednoducho použiť a dokonca "
"uložiť ako vlastné efekty s ich nastaveniami na použitie v iných projektoch"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:73
msgid ""
"Keyframeable effects with linear or smooth curves (more to come in future "
"versions)"
msgstr ""
"Efekty s keyframe podporou s lineárnymi alebo plynulými krivkami (v budúcich "
"verziách pribudne viac)"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:75
msgid ""
"Simple tools for easy creation of color clips, text clips and image clips"
msgstr ""
"Jednoduché nástroje na ľahké vytváranie farebných klipov, textových klipov a "
"obrázkových klipov"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:77
msgid ""
"Automatic :doc:`clip creation </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"image_sequence>` from pictures directories, with crossfade transitions among "
"the images"
msgstr ""
"Automatické :doc:`vytváranie klipov</project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin/image_sequence>` z priečinkov s obrázkami s prechodmi crossfade "
"medzi obrázkami"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:79
msgid ""
"Configurable keyboard shortcuts, toolbars and interface layouts to "
"accommodate your workflow"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurovateľné klávesové skratky, panely nástrojov a rozloženia rozhrania "
"prispôsobené vášmu pracovnému postupu"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:81
msgid "Audio and video scopes"
msgstr "Audio a video analyzátory"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:83
msgid "Proxy editing for your 4K+ footage"
msgstr "Proxy strih pre záznamy v rozlíšení 4K a vyššom"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:85
msgid "Themable interface supporting dark themes"
msgstr "Rozhranie s podporou tém vrátane tmavých tém"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:87
msgid "... and much more!"
msgstr "a oveľa viac!"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:89
msgid "See the |kdenlive_roadmap| for what the future may bring."
msgstr "Pozrite si |kdenlive_roadmap|, čo nás čaká v budúcnosti."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:97
msgid "Supported formats and codecs"
msgstr "Podporované formáty a kodeky"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:101
msgid ""
"There is no need to import or convert footage prior to editing. Kdenlive "
"knows how to handle any format smoothly and supports the following formats, "
"file types and codecs:"
msgstr ""
"Záznamy nie je potrebné pred strihom importovať ani konvertovať. Kdenlive "
"vie plynule pracovať s akýmkoľvek formátom a podporuje nasledujúce formáty, "
"typy súborov a kodeky:"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:103
msgid "Support for low resolution (DV) camera and camcorder files, including:"
msgstr ""
"Podpora súborov z kamier a videokamier s nízkym rozlíšením (DV), vrátane:"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:105
msgid "DV editing (Raw and AVI)"
msgstr "Strih DV (Raw a AVI)"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:106
msgid "MPEG4-ASP/MP3 (DivX compatible)"
msgstr "MPEG4-ASP/MP3 (kompatibilný s DivX)"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:107
msgid "VOB (DVD)"
msgstr "VOB (DVD)"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:108
msgid "4:3 and 16:9 screen sizes, PAL and NTSC systems"
msgstr "Veľkosti obrazovky 4:3 a 16:9, systémy PAL a NTSC"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:110
msgid ""
"Support for high (HD) and ultra-high (UHD/4K) resolution camcorder files, "
"including:"
msgstr ""
"Podpora súborov z videokamier s vysokým (HD) a ultra vysokým (UHD/4K) "
"rozlíšením, vrátane:"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:112
msgid "MPEG-2, MP4, Matroska, WebM, Apple ProRes 422 HDV"
msgstr "MPEG-2, MP4, Matroska, WebM, Apple ProRes 422 HDV"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:113
msgid "H264 AAC HDV"
msgstr "H264 AAC HDV"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:114
msgid "H265"
msgstr "H265"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:115
msgid "Native HDV editing, 720 and 1080, interlaced or full frames"
msgstr "Natívny strih HDV, 720 a 1080, prekladaný alebo progresívny"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:117
msgid "Support for brand new codecs and formats:"
msgstr "Podpora najnovších kodekov a formátov:"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:119
msgid "SNOW lossless codec"
msgstr "Bezstratový kodek SNOW"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:120
msgid "Ogg vorbis, etc ..."
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis atď..."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:121
msgid "Since version 22.08: LOTTIE and RAWR animations"
msgstr "Od verzie 22.08: animácie LOTTIE a RAWR"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:123
msgid ""
"Ability to mix different video sources in a single project. For example, you "
"can edit a film using two sources: a small mpeg4 camera and an HDV mpeg2 "
"camcorder."
msgstr ""
"Možnosť miešania rôznych video zdrojov v jednom projekte. Napríklad môžete "
"strihať film z dvoch zdrojov: malej kamery mpeg4 a videokamery HDV mpeg2."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:125
msgid ""
"Any resolution. Kdenlive will adapt resolution of source files to the "
"resolution of the project."
msgstr ""
"Akékoľvek rozlíšenie. Kdenlive prispôsobí rozlíšenie zdrojových súborov "
"rozlíšeniu projektu."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:126
msgid ""
"Any frame rate (from 15fps to 60 fps or higher). Kdenlive can duplicate/"
"remove frames when needed."
msgstr ""
"Akákoľvek snímková frekvencia (od 15 fps do 60 fps a vyššie). Kdenlive "
"dokáže podľa potreby duplikovať alebo odstraňovať snímky."

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:128
msgid "A wide range of image import formats:"
msgstr "Široká škála formátov importu obrázkov:"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:130
msgid "PNG, GIF, JPEG (jp2, jpe, jpeg, jpg, jpg2), TGA, TIFF, SVG, WEBP"
msgstr "PNG, GIF, JPEG (jp2, jpe, jpeg, jpg, jpg2), TGA, TIFF, SVG, WEBP"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:131
msgid "Since version 22.08: AVIF, HEIF, HEIC, JPEG XL"
msgstr "Od verzie 22.08: AVIF, HEIF, HEIC, JPEG XL"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:133
msgid "Export to most formats"
msgstr "Export do väčšiny formátov"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:135
msgid ""
"Export to any format supported by |ffmpeg|, including DVD (PAL and NTSC), "
"MPEG-2 and MP4 (PAL, NTSC and HD, UHD/4K), Matroska-H264/H265, AAC, AC3, "
"MP3, Apple ProRes 422"
msgstr ""
"Export do akéhokoľvek formátu podporovaného |ffmpeg|, vrátane DVD (PAL a "
"NTSC), MPEG-2 a MP4 (PAL, NTSC a HD, UHD/4K), Matroska-H264/H265, AAC, AC3, "
"MP3, Apple ProRes 422"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:136
msgid ""
"Export to animated GIF or as image sequence in other formats, including BMP, "
"DPX, JPEG, PNG, PPM, TGA, TIFF, WEBP"
msgstr ""
"Export do animovaného GIF alebo ako sekvenciu obrázkov v iných formátoch, "
"vrátane BMP, DPX, JPEG, PNG, PPM, TGA, TIFF, WEBP"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:137
msgid "Lossless/HQ like FFV1, H.264, HuffYUV and Ut Video"
msgstr "Bezstratové/HQ kodeky ako FFV1, H.264, HuffYUV a Ut Video"

#: ../../getting_started/introduction.rst:138
msgid "Video with Alpha (Alpha MOV, Alpha VP8, Alpha VP9, Ut Video)"
msgstr "Video s alpha kanálom (Alpha MOV, Alpha VP8, Alpha VP9, Ut Video)"

